    fix(auger): AUG-212 — classify mid-run ambient substrate contention in the ask-loop refusal test as a named skip
    
    Judge verdict 4572d101 (AUG-211's tier-1 at b6b3425) recorded 2 failed /
    911 passed / 4 skipped where three same-tip runs graded green; the named
    failure was test_ask_stores_nothing_when_a_gate_refuses_the_proposal's
    stub arm "the gate returned no answered-verdict". Cause (a), ambient
    dependence (the AUG-210 family): the session preflight's AUGER_BLOCKED_BY
    sentinel only guards a blocker present at SESSION START, so a full-fleet
    sync push that starts MID-RUN lands inside the ask verb's live reads as
    the substrate's own contention refusals — shapes the harness did not
    classify. Live evidence while fixing: TWO real
    "node --import tsx bin/duckbrain.ts s3 sync all push" runs (pids
    1335969 and 1745558) fired on the host within 30 minutes and the
    preflight named both; the failing run's own pytest capture is truncated
    at the verdict, so the unclassified shapes are classified by the
    measured signatures instead of the lost traceback.
    
    - tests/conftest.py: run_cli classifies the MEASURED ambient contention
      signatures, fail-closed — "failed (503)" + SERIALIZER_LOCKED (the
      AUG-209 lock body landing on a read or an untyped write path; the skip
      reason reuses the AUG-209 convention text so scripts/gate_skip_bound.py
      counts it in the same lock-storm bound) and "failed (409)" +
      push-in-flight/sync-push (the AUG-197 measured conflict). Every other
      SystemExit keeps its loud path, including the deliberate
      non-contention 503s the AUG-076/AUG-085 tests pin.
    - tests/test_auger.py: the parametrized refusal test classifies the ask
      verb's AUG-075 fail-closed rc=1 ("substrate unavailable — cannot
      ask") as a NAMED SKIP carrying the store's own words; five new
      regression tests (sentinel-seam end-to-end x2, harness unit seams x2,
      loud-path pins x5 params) RED-proven against the base tree —
      evidence/AUG-212/red-proof.txt: 4 failed / 5 passed pre-fix, 12/12
      green post-fix at the same tree.
    
    Addresses AUG-212.
    
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
    
    Environment note: first guard run (071646) failed on the worktree venv itself — uv venv ships no pip (the wheel arm ERRORS, AUG-129 demands fail-loud) — fixed by installing pip into .venv; no repo change.
